Removed ``ATTACH`` from :attr:`Alarm.singletons <icalendar.cal.alarm.Alarm.singletons>`. An "email" ``VALARM`` may carry more than one ``ATTACH`` per :rfc:`5545` section 3.6.6, so ``ATTACH`` belongs in ``multiple`` only; it was previously listed in both ``singletons`` and ``multiple``. Added a regression test that ``singletons`` and ``multiple`` are disjoint for every registered component. Prepared with the assistance of an AI coding agent (Anthropic's Claude Opus 4.8). @vtino17
